---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import "../styles/legal.css";
const title="Privacy Policy | WILLDUET CORP.";
const description="Learn how WILLDUET CORP. collects, uses, and handles information submitted through its website and consulting inquiries.";
const sections=["Introduction","Information We Collect","How We Use Information","Website Forms","Analytics and Advertising Technologies","Cookies and Similar Technologies","Third-Party Services","Data Retention","Data Security","Privacy Rights and Requests","External Links","Changes to This Privacy Policy","Contact Us"];
const id=(value)=>value.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g,"-").replace(/^-|-$/g,"");
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/privacy-policy/" lang="en" preloadImage=""><Header/><main class="legal-main"><div class="legal-shell"><header class="legal-header"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="legal-updated">Last Updated: September 2026</p></header><nav class="legal-toc" aria-label="Table of contents"><strong>Contents</strong><ol>{sections.map(section=><li><a href={`#${id(section)}`}>{section}</a></li>)}</ol></nav><div class="legal-content">
<section id="introduction"><h2>1. Introduction</h2><p>This Privacy Policy describes how WILLDUET CORP. collects, uses, and handles information when visitors use this website or contact the company.</p></section>
<section id="information-we-collect"><h2>2. Information We Collect</h2><p><strong>Information provided directly by visitors.</strong> Depending on how you contact us, you may provide your name, email address, phone number, company information, project or inquiry information, messages, and other information you voluntarily submit through forms.</p><p><strong>Technical information.</strong> The website uses Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, and Ahrefs Web Analytics. These technologies may process technical and usage information such as IP address, browser or device information, referring source, website interactions, and analytics information, in accordance with their respective configurations and practices.</p></section>
<section id="how-we-use-information"><h2>3. How We Use Information</h2><p>We may use information to:</p><ul><li>respond to inquiries and communicate with prospective clients;</li><li>provide information requested by visitors;</li><li>evaluate potential consulting engagements;</li><li>operate and improve the website;</li><li>measure website usage when analytics are enabled;</li><li>prevent spam, abuse, or security issues; and</li><li>meet applicable legal obligations.</li></ul></section>
<section id="website-forms"><h2>4. Website Forms</h2><p>Website form submissions are processed using Basin. Information submitted through a form may be processed by Basin for the purpose of transmitting the inquiry to WILLDUET CORP.</p></section>
<section id="analytics-and-advertising-technologies"><h2>5. Analytics and Advertising Technologies</h2><p><strong>Google Analytics.</strong> The website uses Google Analytics 4 to measure website usage and understand how visitors interact with pages.</p><p><strong>Meta Pixel.</strong> The website uses Meta Pixel for website measurement, advertising attribution, and conversion measurement.</p><p><strong>Ahrefs Web Analytics.</strong> The website uses Ahrefs Web Analytics to measure website traffic and usage.</p></section>
<section id="cookies-and-similar-technologies"><h2>6. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2><p>The verified analytics and advertising technologies may use cookies or similar technologies to recognize browsers or devices, measure interactions, and support analytics, attribution, or advertising functions. This website does not currently present a cookie consent management interface.</p></section>
<section id="third-party-services"><h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2><p>The website uses Basin, Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, and Ahrefs Web Analytics. These third-party services operate under their own privacy practices and policies, which WILLDUET CORP. does not control.</p></section>
<section id="data-retention"><h2>8. Data Retention</h2><p>WILLDUET CORP. retains personal information for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes for which it was collected, legitimate business needs, dispute resolution, and applicable legal obligations.</p></section>
<section id="data-security"><h2>9. Data Security</h2><p>WILLDUET CORP. uses reasonable measures to protect information. However, no electronic transmission or storage method can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p></section>
<section id="privacy-rights-and-requests"><h2>10. Privacy Rights and Requests</h2><p>Subject to applicable law, individuals may contact WILLDUET CORP. regarding access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information, or with privacy questions and concerns. Requests may be sent to <a href="mailto:contact@willduet.com">contact@willduet.com</a>.</p></section>
<section id="external-links"><h2>11. External Links</h2><p>The website may contain links to third-party websites. WILLDUET CORP. is not responsible for the content or privacy practices of those external services.</p></section>
<section id="changes-to-this-privacy-policy"><h2>12. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2><p>WILLDUET CORP. may update this Privacy Policy when its website practices or applicable requirements change. The date above identifies the latest update.</p></section>
<section id="contact-us"><h2>13. Contact Us</h2><p>WILLDUET CORP.<br/><a href="mailto:contact@willduet.com">contact@willduet.com</a></p></section>
</div></div></main><Footer/></BaseLayout>
